	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p15_pilot_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>みなさま！
ヒウンに　とうちゃく　でございます▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>みなさま！
ヒウンに　到着で　ございます▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・到着デモ後、主人公と向き合いメッセージ表示
・ライバルは先に降りている
・続けてswrival_01</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>PWDADDY
ホミカパパ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:23:32" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p15_swrival_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『ここが　ヒウンか……
きいてたよりも　はるかに　でかいな▼
だけど　どこに　にげても
プラズマだんは　さがしだす！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:23:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『ここが　ヒウンか……
きいてたよりも　はるかに　でかいな▼
だけど　どこに　逃げても
プラズマ団は　探しだす！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:23:57" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・続けてswrival_02
・1＝ライバル名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p15_swrival_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>そうだ　[Name:TrainerName Idx="0" ]！
てわけして　さがすからな▼
おたがいの　ライブキャスターに
とうろく　しあうぞ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>そうだ　[Name:TrainerName Idx="0" ]！
手分けして　探すからな▼
お互いの　ライブキャスターに
登録しあうぞ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・振り向いてメッセージ
・ライブキャスターに
　ライバルのあて先登録
・続けてswrival_03
・0＝主人公名</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T11:02:24" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p15_swrival_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>へんな　ふね……
いまどき　はんせん　かよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>変な　船……
いまどき　帆船かよ？▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・停泊しているアジト船をみながら表示
・表示後、c03に向かって移動
　画面外に消えると主人公操作可能に</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>ライバル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ff80</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p15_pilot_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おや？　どうなさいました
タチワキまで　ふねを　だしますよ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>おや？　どうなさいました
タチワキまで　船に　だしますよ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→pilot_03
　いいえ→pilot_04</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-07-19T09:59:23" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>PWDADDY
ホミカパパ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-28T06:24:09" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#ffffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c03p15_pilot_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>よろしいですとも！
それでは　こちらへ　どうぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>よろしいですとも！
それでは　こちらへ　どうぞ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:10" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
